/*
 * snippet::source — one source excerpt, and the lines it shows.
 *
 * A `SourceLine` is a line already cut at its labelled spans, read back by
 * alternating its runs and its labels. A `Snippet` is a run of those under one
 * line number gutter: there is one per file a diagnostic points into, so a
 * column of the excerpt is a column of the file.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::errors::snippet::source
 * @File: ymirc/errors/snippet/source.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
